# Development Environment

- Docker setup exists via [`docker-compose.yml`](mdc:docker-compose.yml) and [`Dockerfile`](mdc:Dockerfile). Use these as a reference for PHP/MySQL versions.
- PHP dependencies: run `composer install` (see [`composer.json`](mdc:composer.json)).
- Node toolchain: run asset builds with scripts in [`package.json`](mdc:package.json). Additional manifests in [`frontedit/package.json`](mdc:frontedit/package.json) and [`build-tools/package.json`](mdc:build-tools/package.json).
- After installing, ensure `system/user/config/config.php` exists and toggle installer via `EE_INSTALL_MODE` in [`.env.php`](mdc:.env.php) when setting up.
- Web entry points are [`index.php`](mdc:index.php) and [`admin.php`](mdc:admin.php).